{"unit_id":"BruceZhang1993__dsh-computer-use-linux#feature-1","repo":"BruceZhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux","commit":"a5c48c0fa104743fb7d4ed8224678e6e36874075","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-linux 的功能「观察并操作桌面」：通过 mcp__cul 工具读取应用辅助功能树、窗口列表和截图，并执行点击、拖动、滚动、输入文字或按键；由 DSH 经 stdio MCP 调用本机 Linux 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:32-48","skills/computer-use-linux/SKILL.md:20-26","skills/computer-use-linux/SKILL.md:54-63"]}
{"unit_id":"BruceZhang1993__dsh-computer-use-linux#feature-2","repo":"BruceZhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux","commit":"a5c48c0fa104743fb7d4ed8224678e6e36874075","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-linux 的功能「注册桌面操作技能」：插件启动时将随包提供的 computer-use-linux 技能加入 DSH 技能目录，让模型或用户可按需调用其中的桌面操作说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:54-66","lib/skill.mjs:89-111"]}
